      "snippet": {
        "line": 463,
        "text": "noncomputable def nominalExteriorRadius : ℝ := max (nominalOuterX W) (max W.controls.radius (nominalHeatSwitch W * Real.exp 3)) — the Lean's X_b for this statement; cartesianExterior h R = {z | z.1 < 1 ∧ R < (cartesianChart h z).2.1}, i.e. X > R"
